+
+| round | batch64 ns/op (Mkeys/s) | scalar64 ns/op (Mkeys/s) | ratio |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | 186.9 (342.4) | 979.6 (65.3) | 5.24x |
+| 2 | 182.0 (351.6) | 1007.0 (63.6) | 5.53x |
+| 3 | 195.5 (327.4) | 1040.0 (61.5) | 5.32x |
+| 4 | 214.6 (298.2) | 917.7 (69.7) | 4.28x |
+| 5 | 182.6 (350.5) | 923.8 (69.3) | 5.06x |
+| 6 | 183.7 (348.4) | 939.6 (68.1) | 5.11x |
+
+That is ~2.9–3.4 ns per key batched against ~14–16 ns per key one at a time; 6/6 rounds at ≥ 2x (bar 2x).
