+### P5. S4b: victim scoring without the view (post-hoc)
+
+Verdict: **candidate, post-hoc**. Under S4's pre-registered rule this patch failed, because CheckAndTouchMissInsert was −0.08% against a 3% bar. S4b re-measures the same patch under a rule relaxed at the person's request after those numbers were known. MissInsert moved from "must drop 3%" to "must not rise". Patch `speed-s4-mass-noview.patch`: go/register.go +24/−4, plus go/mass_exp_test.go +73 (TF_EXP=1).
